commit message:
- new set of S/R, called from GCHEM_READPARMS, to record rank (in pTracer
  array) and number of tracers for geo-chemistry pkg ;
- add some entry points for new geo-chemistry pkg SPOIL

- includes CTRL_OPTIONS.h (instead of CPP_OPTIONS.h)
- remove PARAMS.h (not needed); remove some unused var;
- improve doc (separate S/R arg from loc vars) and error msg (if it stops)

replace
FFLAGS = ${FFLAGS} ${FEXTRAFLAGS}
FOPTIM = ${FOPTIM}
by
FFLAGS = ${FFLAGS}
FOPTIM = ${FOPTIM} ${FEXTRAFLAGS}

for the adjoint, change NonLin-FreeSurf initialisation sequence:
  fill-in h0Fac from INITIALISE_FIXED (in ini_linear_phisurf.F)
  and reset hFac to h0Fac in INITIALISE_VARIA (ini_nlfs_vars.F).

- Switch to write qtmp2 (instead of always qtmp1) for Post-Processed diag from
  an other Post-Processed diag.
- Skip computation of 2nd Post-Processed diag if it's still stored in qtmp2 ;

- remove atmCpl_exchange_DIC and ocnCpl_exchange_DIC ;
- rename few variable-ID names (SIceMassName,CO2FluxName,WindSpdName)
  and add some new ones (not yet used, code to be added later on)

- add one argument (the other velocity component) to S/R SHELFICE_U/V_DRAG;
- use SHELFICEDragLinear & SHELFICEDragQuadratic in shelfice_v_drag.F
  (now similar to shelfice_u_drag.F)

re-write S/R ( now more similar to TARGET_NEC_SX part) in orger to:
- refine region where stats are computed, excluding where arrhFac=0 ;
   allows to fix missing interior mask (use with OBCS) in 3-D fields stats;
- expend regional stats over the region edges (for U or V pt location fields)

- put back tmpfld in a local common block (was commented by ...)
- all threads call WRITE_FLD S/R (needed if using SingleCpuIO) ;
- add barrier before writing tmpfld.

no longer used ;
actually, the only array that was in INI_DEPTHS.h was first moved to a local
common in ini_depth.F and has recently been renamed topoZ in SURFACE.h

replace ecco_toolbox functions by loops to disentangle packages

even though the respective code is still within ifdef ALLOW_ECCO;
unify indentation

- define new type of pkg dependency rule ("=pkg_x"), less strict than
  the "+" rule, that add the dependent pkg (pkg_x) unless it's disabled
  (-pkg_x in packages.conf);

improve date checking:
- fatal error returns valid=F ; otherwise, just print warning/error msg.
- check for valid month and stop if not (cause out-of bounds error);
- stop if sign error or wrong Leap year index;
- add warning if date 2nd comp. (hhmmss) is not valid.

- remove test .NOT.useSEAICE, replaced by testing masking flag argument "ckind";
- fix masking if using P-coordinates;
- change recognized masking flag from s,u,v to c,w,s since the mask
  to use (maskC,W,S) depends on position on model grid and has little
  to do with scalar/vector difference.

- rename SMOOTH*_R4,R8 function to the corresponding type (_RS & _RL)
- remove (re-)setting of kSurfW & kSurfS ;
- save hFac[CWS] into h0Fac[CWS] ;
- few editing (e.g., list the Content of this file).

staggerTimeStep without multi-dim advection: move EXCH of velocity field
from do_fields_blocking_exchanges.F to do_stagger_fields_exchanges.F:
this does affect AD output (at machine truncation level); update output.

- fix startTime setting when baseTime<>0 & nIter0=0 are specified ;
- initialise startTime & nIter0 with unlikely values: allows to set one
  from the other without ambiguity.

merge linux_ppc64_xlf+mth, linux_ppc64_xlf_bigred(+mth) and
 linux_ppc64_xlf_ncar(+mth) into this standard optfile ;
add comment about NETCDF_ROOT setting for bigred and ncar built.

- rename parameters: SIsalFrac to SEAICE_saltFrac & SIsal0 to SEAICE_salt0;
- remove old parameters ( SEAICE_freeze, SEAICEturbFluxFormula, SEAICE_gamma_t,
   SEAICE_gamma_t_frz, SEAICE_availHeatTaper & SEAICE_availHeatFracFrz)
  from SEAICE_PARMS.h ;
- move setting of facOpenGrow/Melt from SEAICE_INIT_FIXED to SEAICE_READPARMS
  (safer multi-threaded setting); always set SEAICEuseEVP;
- setting of ocean-ice turb. flux coeff: moved from SEAICE_CHECK to
  SEAICE_READPARMS & SEAICE_INIT_FIXED (this fixes wrong summary report);
  stop if multiple specifications for the same coeff; make sure default
  SEAICE_mcPheePiston is compatible with drF(1) & deltaT.

o pkg/mypackage:
  - add example of read/write pickup for state-var ;
  - add entry points to the main code for state-vars diags & write-pickup.

- remove space after colon in fields array specification to avoid problems with
  open64 on aces (e.g., change "fields(1: 5,3) =... " to "fields(1:5 ,3) = ...")
- fix number of fields in stat_fields;

Improve comments and docs

- add description of new param "gencost_kLev_select" in ECCO.h ;
  change to more standard upper/lower case writing ;
- more standard description of (new) hearder files ECCO.h & ECCO_SIZE.h ;
- update RST documentation regarding ECCO_SIZE.h

iMin,iMax,jMin,jMax are set within convective_adjustment S/R instead of
 passed as argument ;
fix uninitialized variable Pb by computing rhoK & rhoKm1 over the full domain.

fix wrong type of GLOBAL_SUM in REMOVE_MEAN_RS ;
+ change macros (EXCH & GLOBAL_SUM/MAX) sufix _R4/_R8 to _RS/_RL
  when applied to _RS/_RL variable

- sbobp (global mean ocean bottom pressure ?) computation was strange ;
  => change it ; also remove few unused variables.
- should use array "rA" for grid-cell area (instead of dyF*dxF)

minor fixes (including comments)

- write binary snap-shot from my82/my82_output.F even if using pkg mnc ;
- cleaner my82/my82_readparms.F for multi-threaded ;
- fix some comments

EXCH & GLOBAL_SUM/MAX macros: change to "logical" suffix (_R4,_R8,_RS,_RL)
  correspondance between macro and S/R ;
- reduce number of macro definitions (keep only those which are used);
  can always call directly the corrresponding S/R if needed.

cleaning

- remove 500+ lines of MITgcm general description that don't get updated when
  main version (in model/src) is; add a relevant comment/description ;
- avoid changing back and forth "writeBinaryPrec" by using WRITE_REC_3D_RL ;
- remove Divided-Adjoint pieces of code ; remove some un-used var ;
- import some improvements from model/src version.

Change EXF_READ_EVAP to only activate code within #ifdef ALLOW_ATM_TEMP ;
 this prevent to read evap when ALLOW_ATM_TEMP is undef and other fields,
 e.g. precip, are not available.

cleaning

- remove trailing blanks ;
- add a "End-Of-Line" to the last line of dic_readparms.F & car_flux_omega_top.F files ;
- add description of "selectCalciteDissolution" to DIC_VARS.h ;
- set second value of CalciteDissolutionRateK/Exp to some default (was previously
  not set to anything, except if compiling with F90) ;
- fix typo in STDOUT report for second value of CalciteDissolutionRateK/Exp
  (used when omega < 0.8272 instead of > 0.8272).

o move pkg timeave out of pkg-groups "oceanic" & "atmospheric" (pkg/pkg_groups)
o remove MINIMAL_TAVE_OUTPUT option ;
  add "dumpInitAndLast" to replace "nodumps" (and MINIMAL_TAVE_OUTPUT).

clean-up old parameters setting (from Sep 2012):
 - remove old parameters setting from common block (declared locally);
 - stop if any old parameter is mixed with new parameters;
 - check for valid or consistent parameter setting (e.g., layers_name)

- change GLOBAL_SUM to GLOBAL_SUM_TILE (result independent of tile to
  proc/thread mapping);
- fix Min & Max for case where 1 thread has only empty tiles;
- use RL variable to count number of wet grid points (with big domain,
  can be too large to fit into integer*4).

OBCS changes: - reset dEtaHdt and wVel to zero outside OB interior region;
 - call OBCS_APPLY_W only if NonHydrostatic
 - comment out call to OBCS_APPLY_ETA(etaN).

- new options 1) to account for true vertical distance (including hFac)
     in vertical viscous flux and diffusive flux ;
  2) to increase vertical mixing near surface and/or bottom where partial
     cell is too thin ;
- for now, both additions above are within: #ifndef EXCLUDE_PCELL_MIX_CODE ;

-avoid the use of "seq" command (not so standard);
-adjust number of MPI processors in COMMAND by replacing TR_NPROC
 (instead of "-np XX").

document this for genmake2:
replace
FFLAGS = ${FFLAGS} ${FEXTRAFLAGS}
FOPTIM = ${FOPTIM}
by
FFLAGS = ${FFLAGS}
FOPTIM = ${FOPTIM} ${FEXTRAFLAGS}

few minor edits

- remove consecutive blank lines ;
- reduce differences vs original version

Start a new way to set-up optionally-exchanged variables (previously, only
 there for exchange_DIC): switch on/off from 1 place, at run-time, in coupler
 data.cpl (new) instead of at compile time in ATMIDS.h & OCNIDS.h ;
- move checking of comp. configs out of cpl_exch_configs.F into new S/R
  ATM/OCN_CHECK_CPLCONFIG;
- add error-counter to track errors (e.g., in "data.cpl") and to stop
  cleanly in ATM/OCN_CHECK_CPLCONFIG;
- add new S/R CPL_IMPORT_CPLPARMS to import coupling-exchange selectors
  from coupler ; called from initialise_fixed.F, after PACKAGES_BOOT and
  before PACKAGES_READPARMS;

- move setting of GM and KPP diffusivity out of OFFLINE_FIELDS_LOAD into new
  S/R OFFLINE_GET_DIFFUS that is called towards the end of DO_OCEANIC_PHYS;
- simplify rescaling of offline horiz. velocity with Non-Lin Free-Surf.

rename TsfDummy + shorten few arg names

- rename TsfDummy to Tsf_mlt (surface temp metling point)
- rename 3 arguments (dropping suffix "1") to recover original name
  (i.e., before 2013-04-13 renaming) and adjust debug printed msg;
- rename "evap00" to "evap_0" (an other old renaming from Oct 2012);
- re-work argument & local var description, units consistently within
  square brackets, few little improvements;
- finish previous modification regarding replacing "Tsfc" in comments.

Introduce new parameter SEAICEscaleSurfStress (default = .FALSE.);
if TRUE scale ice-ocean and ice-atmosphere stress acting on sea ice
by AREA according to Connelly et al. (2004), JPO.

remove variable "divergence" and associated code;
contained artificial divergence rate for test of ITD code in 1-D test case;
never meant to be permanently introduced

- use buffer for floats IO (trajectories & profiles); size set in FLT_SIZE.h;
- fix for multi-threaded;
- add parameter to select group of fields to write along trajectory and
  profile (default unchanged).

Use new input files ( NCEP, FFT filtered in high lat (> 55) ;
Turn on exactConserv ;
no Shapiro on T&S ;
FFT: 2.dx mode removed only in High latitude (> 45).

- remove 2 arguments (modenddate_1 & 2) to S/R CAL_SET
- remove/comment-out useless (+confusing) parts of code;
- fix for case baseTime <> 0

remove completly "OmegaCave"

- was zero without CAR_DISS (now DIC_CALCITE_SAT) defined ;
- there is now a diagnotics for this field ;
- also tweak #ifdef DIC_CALCITE_SAT / if useCalciteSaturation in dic_biotic_forcing.F
  to simplify dependencies for the Adjoint (case DIC_CALCITE_SAT undef).

switch to specific Fortran-version option when TAF_FORTRAN_VERS is set

- new env var "TAF_FORTRAN_VERS" to select which Fortran version is sent to TAF;
- default is unchanged: use '-f90' if ALWAYS_USE_F90 is set and otherwise use '-f77';
- for now, when (new) var "TAF_FORTRAN_VERS" is set, switch to TAF default '-f95';
- recover previous setting for AD experiment "halfpipe_streamice" (which has been using
  ALWAYS_USE_F90=1 and "adjoint_f95" ad-optfile);

Also:
- do not reset var "SHOW_MPI_TO_TAF" (more flexible for dvlp/test/debug);
- minor: remove tab inside "-input" list (--> shorter line in Makefile);

o move state variable diagnostics to the beginning of the time step ;
  (note: still needs some work specially for snap-shot diagnostics)
  duplicate & replace UVELVVEL diagnostics with UV_VEL_C & UV_VEL_Z

- write missing value (corresponding to undefined array value) to meta files;
  skip this if missing value is one (UNSET_RL would be a better value for the
  case of undefined missing value but it's current the default missing-value);

- switch-off more output flags (exf_monFreq, chkPtFreq, dumpInitAndLast,
  writePickupAtEnd) and call specific pkg S/R for seaice & ptracers;
- do not switch off MNC flags (otherwise, won't get admonitor netcdf file)

Make ptracers gen-control more general

More general way to deal with number of ptracers generic-control:
- extend to any ptracers number from 1 to 9, ctrl file: xx_ptr1 -> xx_ptr9 ;
- reduce number of lines of code (less prone to mistake);
- no risk of exceeding Total number of tracers (PTRACERS_num, PTRACERS_numInUse);
- since this check for the length of ctrl file, can easily be extended to, e.g.,
  10+ ptracers (with 2 digit number) or 100+ ptracers (with 3 digit number).

re-visit surface-relaxation setting (with exf):
- do not modify internal flags doThetaClimRelax or doSaltClimRelax
  (left from modif in Aug 2011, when do-Theta/Salt-ClimRelax setting was moved
   from ini_parms.F to set_parms.F)
- do not reset thetaClimFile/saltClimFile if using EXF (like other forcing files);
- stop if tau-Theta/Salt-ClimRelax was already set (even if
    ALLOW_CLIMSST/SSS_RELAXATION is undef ; add a note for this case);
- move the stop "if clim-sst/sss-TauRelax <>0 but no file" from exf_readparms.F
  to exf_check.F ; add a stop if ALLOW_CLIMSST/SSS_RELAXATION is undef.

- use new S/R version for statistics with mask & volume;
- use interior masks (instead of maskH, <- to be remove).
- fix multi-tiles (C-grid) uIce,vIce monitor

USE_EXF_INTERPOLATION : add a set of run-time param ({inputfield}_interpMethod),
    one for each interpolated input field, to select the interpolation method
    with a value of zero switching off the interpolation;

update reference outputs

from test experiment "1D_ocean_ice_column" (KPPuseSWfrac3D=T in "data.kpp")
and from experiment "global_ocean.cs32x15" (in_p & seaice tests).

o packages pickup: $PKG_write_pickup called from packages_write_pickup ;
   but call to $PKG_read_pickup remains in $PKG_ini_vars: change CD_code
   to conform to the common rule.

- fix bug in the no-slip implementation in, this bug changes two
  verification experiments, recover old (wrong) results by setting
  noSlipFac = 2. in seaice_calc_strainrates.F;

fix some loose ends with untested code options

CPP-flags needs to be reworked, if we stick with this approach;
currently, there are flags common to DIC/BLING, that are not used in GCHEM

results change after revision 1.18 of seaice_growth.F (Jun 30 20:21, 2007);
and generate new output (code from cvs co -D "2007-07-07 20:00")
after fixing exf & seaice offline monitor (on Sat, 7 Jul 2007 09:20:20)

- add argument nNz (= number of levels) to S/R EXF_SWAPFFIELDS_3D,
  EXF_SWAPFFIELDS_XZ & EXF_SWAPFFIELDS_YZ ;
- remove S/R EXF_SWAPFFIELDS_X & EXF_SWAPFFIELDS_Y.

- new driver S/R: LOAD_FIELDS_DRIVER to load external forcing fields
  from file (collects calls previously in FORWARD_STEP)
- move call to SEAICE_MODEL from FORWARD_STEP to DO_OCEANIC_PHYS

change S/R DIAGNOSTICS_GET_POINTERS: add 1 argument that allow to catch
 the "right" diagnostic (since 1 diagnostic can be stored multiple times,
 for different output frequency,phase, ...)

revert changes:

1) changes only affect commented out calls so it does not matter so much ;
2) it cannot be tested ;
3) the original calls to mdsreadfield have not been updated to call instead MDS_READ_FIELD
   so it's probably better to keep this unchanged.

Modifications to comment formats for automated extraction of name definition
info. used in browsable code.

Format mods allow info. to be extracted by a parser for input into the
browsable code generating program. e.g.

CG2D_INTERNAL.h                                    {TEXT=" Header file for two-dimensional  conjugate gradient solver common  blocks.";}
aW2d                                               {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver east-west operator.";}
aS2d                                               {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver north-south operator.";}
pW                                                 {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver east-west off-diagonal term of preconditioner.";}
pS                                                 {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver north-south off-diagonal term of preconditioner.";}
pC                                                 {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver main diagonal term of preconditioner.";}
cg2dNorm                                           {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver A matrix normalisation factor.";}
cg2d_q                                             {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver intermediate matrix-vector product term ";}
cg2d_r                                             {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver intermediate matrix-vector product term ";}
cg2d_s                                             {TEXT=" Two-d con. grad solver intermediate matrix-vector product term ";}

Update exchanged fields for IDEMIX

1) When useIDEMIX=T and IDEMIX_tau_h > 0 (horizontal diffusion of IDEMIX_E),
   exchange both IDEMIX_E and GGL90TKE ;
2) skip EXCH of IDEMIX_V0 (not needed);
3) With IDEMIX_tau_h=0 (no horizontal diffusion) no need for additional EXCH.

revert to cvs version 1.6 ;
v 1.6: #define SEAICE_VARIABLE_SALINITY
v 1.7: #undef SEAICE_VARIABLE_SALINITY

fix multi-threading by using same method as in all other monitor S/R ;
write a specific "ptracer_monitor.*.nc" file (this fix the Pb when freq
 was different from main-monitor)

- fix for multi-tiles (add bi,bj indices to exp/impMatrixCounter);
- fix for multi-threaded (remove DATA statement);
- use standard DIFFERENT_MULTIPLE function;
- add MATRIX_OPTIONS.h

take OBCS_CHECK_TOPOGRAPHY out of obcs_check.F and rename it
"OBCS_CHECK_DEPTHS"; motivation: 1) called from ini_depths ;
2) could be adapted for P-coord (isomorphism & ocean in P).

split PTRACERS.h in 2 header files: PTRACERS_FIELDS.h & PTRACERS_PARAMS.h :
temporary: add this header file to allow to compile this code (as it);
 will be removed once the customized source code is updated.

- define variable MAKE within Makefile and use it in place of 'make';
- update AD_CONFIG.h (if needed) before building any of the executable
  (forward, adjoint or tangent-lin); this involves a 2nd invocation of make;
  and add the usual #ifndef/#define AD_CONFIG_H in AD_CONFIG.h;

simplify computation of Rossby wave speed

requires a version of rotate_uv2en that works on tiles;
use the new routine within the global rotate_uv2en_rl (this is a suggestion)

add new CPP option (DISCONNECTED_TILES) to disconnect tiles (no exchange
 between tiles, just fill-in edges assuming locally periodic subdomain) and
 add corresponding exchange subroutines (EXCH0);

fix previous modif: move report of new parameter at a better place

new parameter "SEAICEupdateOceanStress" was missing when SEAICEuseDYNAMICS=F;
move print before seaice-dynamics summary, in time-stepping section.

add option: -skd|-skipdir to skip some test (usefull since full list is
 getting long);
remove "show_help" (not used, not up-to-date, was copied from testscript ?).

Changed to F77 standard

These simple copy were the only F90 syntax feature in this file;
more portable to stick to F77 (+ no real advantage to mix both in same file).

update results after changes in seaice_lsr.F (rearrangement of store directives);
at this point we (I!) do not care, because the gradients are wrong anyway, especially
when SEAICE_LSR_ADJOINT_ITER (as in this experiment) is not set.

staggerTimeStep without multi-dim advection: move EXCH of velocity field
from do_fields_blocking_exchanges.F to do_stagger_fields_exchanges.F:
this does affects AD output (at machine truncation level); update output.

- move initialisation of all horizontal grid arrays to null value
  from specific horizontal grid S/R to main S/R INI_GRID;
- initialise new projection array for model C-grid velocity;
- initialise horizontal grid reciprocal arrays.

- only apply EXCH once (for each var) instead of maxCtrlArr2D,3D times ;
- add necessary #ifdef around bottomdragfld and diffKr code. ;
- remove some local copy (equal,itlo,ithi ...) and usused var (tmptest).

Adding single-precision capability;
Eventually this should be rewritten in terms of the read_llc_fkij
primitive, which is much faster aand uses less memory.

o change tiling of natl_box (from 2 to 4 tiles) to get it tested with MPI+MTH
o can now use pkg/exch2 for regular (non CS) set-up; switch test experiment
  MLAdjust to exch2 (identical results except with MPI -> truncation diff);

- add new common block to store velocity increment 3-D factor due to
  surf. pressure gradient when using Implicit bottom friction (& vert. visc);
  for now, only compiled when CPP option ALLOW_SOLVE4_PS_AND_DRAG is defined.

a) drop cd_scheme, useJamartWetPoints=T and increase viscAh ;
b) use ivdc_kappa with implicit Diff & Visc ;
c) switch off SHELFICEboundaryLayer, turn on pCellMix_select (=20) and
   use SHELFICEselectDragQuadr=1 ;

o eesupp (global_max & global_sum):
 - add one more element to buffer (start at index 0) for GL_MAX/SUM output;
 - remove starting & endding barrier (no longer needed)

with OBCS: use maskInC to cancel cg2d-matrix coeff at OB
 and also outside OB interior region (<- was missing in previous code);
This can change cg2d Norm value and, as a consequence, can affect the results.

- removed S/R mdsio_writevec_loc from mdsio_ad.flow list
- add argument to by-pass Open/Close of file ;
- add option to by-pass writing of meta file.

o pkg/exf:
  move exf header files from lower_case.h to UPPER_CASE.h ;
  add missing cvs Header & Name

update verification/*/build/.cvsignore:
 -remove output files from mitgcmuv run;
 -add: *.flowdir taf_command & taf_output

- switch the advection scheme used for salinity to prather scheme so that
  SOM-advection on CS-grid will be tested. (keep same Adv.Sc. for theta);
- use a shorter time step (45 mn instead of 1.h) to keep the CFL below 1.

Change diagnostics of total angular momentum:
- do not add Eta contribution if using rigid-lid;
- correction for Adams-Bashforth done in zonal-wind part (instead of
  in Eta contribution);
- horizontal discretisation: compute Zonal wind contribution separately for
  each component (instead of from cell centered averaged) and, regarding
  Eta contribution, use the 4 grid-cell corner averaged value of Omega*r^2;
In the linear dynamics case (momAdvection=F and linear FreeSurf),
 get exact conservation of AM if using vectorInvariant momentum.

since we no longer build the executable in code dir but in build dir,
no need to keep a cvsignore file here; plus many experiments don't have one;
and can also be confusing when doing a cvs update.

minor edits

- remove consecutive blank lines ; improve new code indentation ;
- avoid comparing real parameter with integer value.

o pkg/kpp: add "_d 0" to real constant (if missing);
  update output of exp: natl_box (10.digits); vermix (std, 7.digits)
  and lab_sea, 3.FW (only 6,4,6 digits match) & AD (8.digits).

- set OMPFLAG to be used for multi-threaded compilation (with genmake2 -mth);
  no longer need the similar +mth optfifle which will be removed soon.
- start to remove "-r8 -i4" option (more similar to other compiler optfile).

o move from external_forcing_surf.F to ini_forcing.F
  the p-coord. hack consisting in using pLoad to set phi0surf ;
  update output of tutorial_global_oce_in_p (affected @ truncation level).

switch 2 params to Integer + remove 1 other

- remove completely "writeStatePrec" (not used);
- replace logical "metricTerms" param with integer param "selectMetricTerms";
- replace logical "use3dCoriolis" param with integer param "select3dCoriScheme";
