Fix compilation with #undef GM_BOLUS_ADVEC

and #define GM_BOLUS_BVP ;
and bring back original GMREDI_OPTIONS.h

o pkg/exch2:
 - new code to set-up W2-Exch2 topology (replace matlab-topology-generator):
   new header file "W2_EXCH2_SIZE.h";

replace remaining calls to old S/R DIAGNOSTICS_ADD2LIST with newer S/R
 DIAGNOSTICS_ADDTOLIST ;
 fix add few parser code 3 ; fix few vertical position flag (U -> L).

added a few "_d 0" and D0 (in PARAMETER statements) in a desperate
effort to make vermix.my82 pass on a Sun, unfortunately no success;
but for cleaner code I check it in anyway.

- no longer reset forcing fields that are not loaded (corresponding
  to an empty filename) ;
- take away LEF_ZERO S/R (moved to eesupp/src/lef_zero.F);

- add 2 diagnostics for wVel*delta^k(Rho) at constant pressure (= WdRHO_P)
  and at constant T,S (= WdRHOdP);
- change diagnostics WRHOMASS, now simply the Vertical transport
  of In-Situ Density (Anomaly) (=wVel*rho^bar-k) (previously was Vertical
  transport of locally-referenced potential density);

- modify obcs_diag_balance.F to process each connected-part separately;
  exclude OB where Id = 0 but keep the full divergence there (-> constant
  Psi along this portion of OB and all inflow derived from grad(Phi))

Simplify + more robust:

- use compiler type conversion for Integer to Real*8 instead of "FLOAT"
  (which results in 2 conversions, from Int to real*4 and then to real*8,
   with (unlikely) risk of round-off when converting large integer);
- do not stop when length is smaller than size of local 2-D array (it should
  just works fine);
- remove few unused included headers and functions;
- S/R arguments description and declaration listed in the same order as in S/R argument list

- introduce tile exchange for HEFFITD, AREAITD, and HSNOWITD;
- move calls to DIAGNOSTICS_FILL for SIheffN and SIareaN
  from seaice_model.F to seaice_diagnostics_state.F

Change parameters run:
 * run with partial cell ;
 * no Shapiro on T & S ;
 * Turn on exactConserv and turn off uniformLin_PhiSurf ;
 * use new input files (NCEP climato), new topographyi ;
 * start from a pickup file (3 month).

- add new check & stop when file-name is defined but not read-in ;
- add warning when file is read-in but not used within pkg/exf ;
+ check for buffer-size (if #undef EXF_INTERP_USE_DYNALLOC).

- add diagnostics for all imported fields from coupler (in both OCN & ATM);
  this is entended to replace the OCN cplFldtave.* output files (not updated
  to contain new additional exchanged fields).

o Yet another change to suppress recomp. loop for DIVA
  while keeping monitor and diagnostics (but suppress checkpointing)
o Catch a few divisions by zero for non-used cost terms (weights=0)

import modifications from pkg/exf version:
- use EXF_OPTIONS.h to set pkg/exf options except if done in ECCO_CPPOPTIONS.h
  (previously, ALLOW_AUTODIFF_TAMC was controling this switch)

Move wind-stress over seaice out of SEAICE.h

 - move wind-stress over seaice out of SEAICE.h into local seaice_dynsolver.F
   common block ;
 - change argument list of S/R SEAICE_OCEAN_STRESS: pass wind-stress over seaice
   as (new) argument to this S/R ; change calling S/R accordingly ;
 - move initialisation of TAUX & TAUY from seaice_init_varia.F to seaice_dynsolver.F

switch to compile with #undef SHORTWAVE_HEATING

- since no short-wave was provided, not expecting any differences ;
- allows to check that pkg/kpp compiles with #undef SHORTWAVE_HEATING
  (was not tested before) ;
- and since SHORTWAVE_HEATING was the only setting that was different from
  default CPP_OPTIONS.h, no need for a cusomized CPP_OPTIONS file anymore.

- add diagnostics for 3-D, Nr+1 levels diagnostics of radiative fluxes
  (shortwave & longwave, net & downward) and diagnostics of temp. tendency
  for individual contribution (convection, LSC cond, radiation)

fix and clean-up

- add missing CTRL_OPTIONS.h (S/R was mostly empty without ALLOW_DEPTH_CONTROL
  being defined);
- comment out resetting of "writeBinaryPrec" (which is not safe);
- call PRINT_ERROR & PRINT_MESSAGE with myThid argument;
- avoid un-used variables.

- change implementation for case of windspeed + 2. components wind-stress input
- remove us (use wspeed instead); add wStress ;
- use rhoConstFresh (instead of rhoNil) to convert evap (from kg/m^2/s to m/s)

- switch from queue "four" to "one";
- skip also fizhi-cs-aqualev20 in gfortran+mpi test (fail to compile with -r8)
- put back fizhi-cs-32x32x40 in MPI tests with open64, path-scale & pgi compilers

Simplify: remove unused pkg 'kpp' from packages.conf

This makes code simpler (especially for TAF, less recomputaion warnings in global_ocean_ebm);
note that kpp was already not compiled in Adjoint global_ocean.90x40x15.

checkpoint58o_post
o replace calls to EXCH_Z & EXCH_UV_AGRID: use the new _3D_ version ;
  remove old subroutines (_XY_ & _XYZ_); update the adjoint version.

small changes associated with NonLin_FreeSurf option :
* initialization (ini_psurf.F);
* dump hFac fields (write_state.F);
* avoid unnecessary re-computation (forward_step.F initialise_varia.F calc_surf_dr.F);

- pass OB_indexNone as (new) argument to S/R OBCS_MON_STATS_EW,NS_RL;
- If 1 OB location is on 2 tiles (@ edge of 2 tiles), select the one which
  communicates with tile interior rather than with halo region.

Oops, I forgot the initialization of RECIP_CSTICE/CSUICE in the
#ifdef ALLOW_EXCH2 block;
hopefully nobody noticed.

- put surface relaxation of SST & SSS in new S/R (forcing_surf_relax.F)
  which also contains balancing surface relaxation (ALLOW_BALANCE_RELAX,
  previously in file "balance_relax.F", now removed);

- use new S/R version for statistics with mask & volume;
- use interior masks (instead of maskH, <- to be remove).
- fix ustress,vstress monitor

try to avoid the need for file "oadtempflile";
should works as long as this script is not moved (or linked) elsewhere,
 outside of OADTOOLS (i.e., tools/OAD_support).

o pkg/dic: test for "pickup_dic" file when restarting ;
  if no pickup-file, can restart with a re-initialised pH (same as it did
  before) providing pickupStrictlyMatch is set to False.

- fix for case ny_in=1 ;
- remove tab ;
- put i loop inside jloop (instead of the opposite).

- consistent treatment of uWind,vWind location: assume everywhere in
  pkg/cheapaml that they are on C-grid (@ uVel,vVel location)
  (Note: was already the case for Tair,Qair advection);
  add option (INCONSISTENT_WIND_LOCATION) to recover old results.
- compute diabatic forcing only in the interior (excluding overlap regions)
- fill in array "Qsw" (for short-wave heating);
- add diagnostic for precip ; fill-in diagnostics for cheapAML state
  var before any update (consistent with MITgcm state var diagnostics);

Cleaning:

- remove few unused local variables;
- improve indentation;
- at top of src file, add "Content" section with list of S/R that this file contains
- many lower-case changed to upper-case (consistent with standard rules)

include SEAICE_OPTIONS.h ;

also change back ALLOW_AUTODIFF_TAMC to just ALLOW_AUTODIFF around included header file
(as it was originally)

always set horiz. viscosity arrays to background value before calling
 MOM_CALC_VISC (in MOM_FLUXFORM & MOM_VECINV) and call S/R MOM_CALC_VISC
 only when using variable horiz. viscosity (useVariableVisc=T);

add options related to Geopotential computation and Orography definition:
 read orography (in m) from file ; compute Bo_surf(P_ground);
 select the form of geopotential integration;
atmospheric constant (Ideal gas EOS) in common.

minor: upper case / lower case changes

just to be more consistent ;
also improve indentation in seaice_advdiff.F

cleaning:
- add DEVEL option (flag taken from linux_amd64_ifort11) ;
- add flag to get compiler version ;
- do not set FFLAGS (done in genmake2) but append to it ;
- remove "-DALWAYS_USE_MPI" ; set MPIINCLUDEDIR for MPI DIVA (using TAF.

if useSEAICE:
- set stressReduction to zero;
- limit computation domain to tile interior only (because of EXF)
- do exchanges (needed anyway for seaice advection)

add model parameter files to use to run tutorial_global_oce_biogeo
 and from this run, to extract initial conditions and OBCs files
for this Southern-Ocean Box experiment (using script: mk_box_input.m)

fix diagnostics botTauX & botTauY when selectImplicitDrag=0

arrays botDragU, botDragV were reset to zero before filling diagnostics;
remove additional reset to get non-zero diagnostics.

changes for Divided Adjoint Run: when file "run_ADM_DIVA" is present,
 perform additional runs (number of additional runs is "add_DIVA_runs" taken
 from file run_ADM_DIVA ; should match "nchklev_3" in file "code_ad/tamc.h")

- always set horiz. viscosity arrays to background value before calling
  MOM_CALC_VISC (in MOM_FLUXFORM & MOM_VECINV) and call S/R MOM_CALC_VISC
  only when using variable horiz. viscosity (useVariableVisc=T);

Move call to AUTODIFF_INADMODE_UNSET

Move call from just before resetting myTime & myIter  to just after these resetting ;
this avoid 1 TAF recomputation warning.

new options 1) to account for true vertical distance (including hFac)
     in vertical viscous flux and diffusive flux ;
  2) to increase vertical mixing near surface and/or bottom where partial
     cell is too thin ;

Comment out 3rd exch call (no longer needed after changing index bounds);
for now, leave the V to U copy @ face corner (this induces truncation
 differences in adjoint-test global_ocean.cs32x15)

o clean up pkg/dic.
o if using THSICE then use isemask for fice (still need to do this
  for other sea-ice packages)

- rewrite/simplify tape-IO S/R (new S/R MDS_READ/WRITE_TAPE replace
  previous MDSREAD/WRITEVECTOR) with 2 array argument from each type (R4/R8);
- fix globalFile and singleCpuIO options using simpler global mapping.

-remove MULTIDIM_OLD_VERSION code (was disabled 6.years ago).
-remove calls to OBCS_APPLY (applying future time-step OB values);
-use instead "maskInC" to keep current-time-step OB values in OB regions.

- change (rarely used) offset-iteration parameter to an offset time (in s):
  can easily recover previous offset-iter effect by setting offset-time
  (offlineTimeOffset) to offset-iter x deltaToffline;

- always call S/R CALC_GRID_ANGLES to set new new projection array for
  model C-grid velocity;
- remove initialisation of all horizontal grid arrays (done in INI_GRID)

- specific code if using OpenMP threading; improve checking of # of threads
  across processors (e.g., different env OMP_NUM_THREADS setting);
  do not stop but set eeBootError=T.

minor cleaning

- avoid un-used variables ;
- remove trailing blanks and consecutive blank lines ;
- for shared variables, same upper/lower case writing as in header file
- always use the standard way for commented line (a "c" or "C" in first
  column instead of "!").

- initialize R_shelfIce (overlap regions were not);
- all threads call READ_FLD S/R (needed if using SingleCpuIO);
- add barrier before reading (and after initialisation);

change filter parameters:
 Stagger filters (Shapiro and FFT);
 use a time scale = 90mn (=H&S 94 value) for Shapiro ;
 Exact-Conserv and filter uVel,vVel at the end of the time step ;

re-write compact to 2-D map conversion:
- separate compact to faces conversion from faces to 2-D map;
- allow for non regular (i.e., not squared polar face) lat-lon cap;
- extendend for 6 faces case (can be used for standard CS-grid);

o pkg/generic_advdiff:
 - define loop range indices for computing vertical advection tendency
  as parameters (iMinAdvR,iMaxAdvR,jMinAdvR,jMaxAdvR), in GAD.h
  and do the calculation in the interior (no overlap) only ;
  for now, only implemented for SOM advection (to save CPU time)
 - add argument "withSigns" to S/R FILL_CS_CORNER_TR_RL (needed for SOM_xy moment)

towards single optfile for MPI and non-MPI built:
 merge +mpi_generic version into standard optfile (linux_amd64_gfortran):
  * move IEEE flags to DEVEL section; take IEEE flags from +mpi_generic ;
  * FAST case: for now, keep -O3 with ini_masks_etc.F in NOOPTFILES list;
 and use "-devel" testreport option for standard testing on baudelaire.

-fix the USE_ORIGINAL_SBI version (for variable freezing point);
-use "celsius2K" in SEAICE_VARIABLE_FREEZING_POINT and in new
 version (USE_ORIGINAL_SBI undef);
-clean-up unused variables;

- switch to exch2
- split the domain in many more tiles (9x4 tiles of 10x10 each);
- remove 1 blank-tile (but only for MPI test).

mask atemp,aqh,evap,precip,runoff,lwflx,areamask and climsst/sss even
when using seaice (to prevent calculation that might use SST on land);
does not affect any verification exp.

remove duplicated files

all identical to input_ad/ version ;
and easier to maintain this way.

- fix missing interior mask (use with OBCS) in 3-D fields statistics;
- pass grid location (Center, U or V pt) to S/R DIAGSTATS_CALC for
  regional Stats diagnostics (now extended to region edges).

from Contrib verification_other:
 - add experiment "global_oce_cs32" to gfortran+mpi test
 - add experiment "global_oce_biogeo_bling" to ifort test

update output after replacing few divisions by multiplication by reciprocal;
this affects results at the machine truncation level:
Y Y Y Y  8>11< 2 pass  global_ocean.cs32x15.seaice_dynmix

Bug fix (spotted by Eliyahu Biton):
Bracket missing in eqn. for psimh (eqn. 7 of Large & Pond, 1982);
terms -2*ATAN(x) + pi/2 were added to both stable and unstable case.

- change diagnostics WRHOMASS to just the Vertical transport of in-situ density;
- add 2 diagnostics for wVel*delta^k(Rho) at constant pressure (= WdRHO_P)
  and at constant T,S (= WdRHOdP); separated k-loop for rhoInSitu calculation;
- reset addMass to zero only if useICEFRONT.

- new options 1) to account for true vertical distance (including hFac)
     in vertical viscous flux and diffusive flux ;
  2) to increase vertical mixing near surface and/or bottom where partial
     cell is too thin ;
- for now, both additions above are within: #ifndef EXCLUDE_PCELL_MIX_CODE ;
- also re-order options in CPP_OPTIONS.h (little bit more logical)

- fix mask for OBCS (still problems in stream-function with OBCS);
- add specific parameter (default = main code CG2D params) for solver;
- in case of poor convergence, use solution corresponding to lowest residual.

- fix wrong truncation (single prec) from "FLOAT" function in expressions
  like: deltaT*FLOAT(myIter) when myIter is large:
   a) replaced by DFLOAT (if not seen by TAF);

- change definition of "hflux" input file to always include Short-Wave;
  this is now consistent with hflux computation (if using bulk-formulae)
  and hflux diagnostic & documentation (in EXF_FIELDS.h).

- change where Offline-Fields are loaded, from load_fields_driver.F to
  directly within FORWARD_STEP, just after updating iter number and time;
- move setting of GM and KPP diffusivity out of OFFLINE_FIELDS_LOAD into new
  S/R OFFLINE_GET_DIFFUS that is called towards the end of DO_OCEANIC_PHYS;

add options related to Geopotential computation and Orography definition:
  read orography (in m) from file ; compute Bo_surf(P_ground);
  select the form of geopotential integration;

add target "obj" (just for OBJFILES files) to Makefile;
remove unused variable PACKAGES_CONF; shorten genmake_state (remove blanks);
add option to specify FEXTRAFLAGS on command line (hide it for now).

Isolate in 1 new S/R all state variable adjustments

Move adjustment of state variables into (new) dedicated S/R SHELFICE_REMESH_STATE
and change loop range so that no further EXCH calls are needed ;
Also add missing code for ALLOW_ADAMSBASHFORTH_3 ;

Add internal parameter "useDiag4AdjOutp"

to be set to TRUE when using pkg/diagnostics to output Adjoint variables;
for now, hard coded according to CPP option DIAGNOSTICS_ADJ_OUTPUT

o change default MAX_NO_THREADS from 32 to 4 ;
  and stop cleanly when MAX_NO_THREADS is too small.
o add S/R BAR_CHECK to check multi-threaded barrier synchronization

- add parenthesis in Water-Ice drag calculations;
- simplify and fix AA3 setting in case sNx or sNy=1;
- fix case SEAICE_waterDrag=0 (but unstable if no or little seaice)

- update seaice initial conditions (file names);
- use same mcPheePiston value as in thsice with surf-current=0.2 m/s;
- switch on SEAICErestoreUnderIce=T;
- use pkg/diagnostics for snap-shot output

Allow to choose (per experiment) the list of tested output variables
 and the main variable (used to issue a pass/FAIL ) ;
for now, done by adding the specific list in file: [exp]/input/tr_checklist ;
default is unchange: >cg2d< , (T,S,U,V,5 tracers)_[min,max,mean,StD] ;
Also modify printing of summary:
a) ">" NN "<" indicates the "main" variable (pass/FAIL)
b) echo the list of tested variables in the individual summary.txt of
 each experiment.

- skip time-ave over cpl_atmSendFrq of Sea-Level Pressure (atmSLPr) and
  just pass last value, stored directly before export to CPL ;
- remove atmSLPr from pickup files (no longer needed for restart)

o move out off EQUIVALENCE all diagnostics that fizhi does not use ;
  NOTE: change ptracer diagnostics name: use 2 characters to work with
        more than 9 tracers. Add also diagnostics of advect & diffus flux.

updated althougth results have not changed:
 but writing of cg2d_init_res is now shifted back from 1.iter
 (only get 1/5 cg2d_init_res for this particular exp.);

- move to pkg/mom_common and model/src (previously in tutorial_deep_convection
  code) 2nd version of isotropic 3-D Smagorinsky code interface: strain and
  viscosity are locally declared in dynmics.F and pass as argument to CALC_GW;

specific optfile (with suffix "+mth") no longer needed (since Feb 19)
 for multi-threads built: can use equivalent optfile (without suffix)
 with "genmake2 -mth" option.

- with synchronous time-stepping: move resetting to zero of frictionHeating
  field from load_fields_driver.F to thermodynamics.F ;
- add diagnostics for frictional heating.

change (again) "-ncad" Makefile

- bring back original targets "ad_taf_output.f" and "ftl_taf_output.f" (i.e., revert
  earlier commit), and use just a "touch" to get these 2 updated ;
- remove SVD parts from "Makefile" ;
- merge 3 "-rm" lines into 1.

- new S/R for resetting main-model params (switch off flags);
- compute vertical velocity if not read from file (switch exactConserv
  & staggerTimeStep);
- change monitorFreq to print only 1 dynstat monitor at the end; this fixes
  output of ptracer monitor iter & time for default PTRACERS_monitorFreq.

- re-arrange 3 header files (W2_EXCH2_PARAMS.h, _BUFFER.h & _TOPOLOGY.h)
  moving /EXCH2_FILLVAL_RX/ & /W2_EXCH2_COMMFLAG/ to W2_EXCH2_TOPOLOGY.h;
- rename "exch2_tProc" to "W2_tileProc"

refines the checks when thermodynamics is not used (usePW79thermodynamics=F):
- skip few thermodynamics parameter check ;
- allow to use pkg/seaice without pkg/exf.

- add CPP flag to include clipping of zeta in EVP code;
  although clipping of zeta is not necessary for EVP and not recommended
  it was done by default, therefore the flag is defined by default

change how Albedo is computed over sea-ice:
 - separate albedo S/R (thsice_albedo.F) from thsice_therm.F file.
 - use GISS formulation for snow-covered area ; turn on snow-aging ;
 - bare-ice albedo as in LANL code ;
 - addd diagnostic of surface albedo.

rename THSICE_AUTODIFF_REGULARIZE to THSICE_REGULARIZE_CALC_THICKN

and add two lines of documentation in THSICE_OPTIONS.h;
also make it independent of ALLOW_AUTODIFF

small fix for larger # of procs (> 100)

saving of STDOUT & STDERR files of test 2+2 was done only for first 100 ones;
extend it to 1000 or less (was already done for initial STD files of previous run).

- remove default setting of MPIINCLUDEDIR from $MPIHOME (always been broken);
- only create local ./mpi_headers dir if using MPI and MPIINCLUDEDIR is set;
- add new variable (LOCAL_MPI_HEADERS, replace MPI_HEADER_FILES_INC) in
  Makefile, which is set by genmake2, and check which mpi-headers are needed.
  Note: need to update adjoint_options/adjoint_diva_mpi accordingly.
- update target "CLEAN" (to remove ./mpi_headers/ dir).

- check for consistent # of Procs if not using MPI
- when using MPI, always set usingMPI = T (+ set a consistent default);
- argument added to EESET_PARMS for special prelimiary call (in eeboot_minimal)
